
A full-stack web application that allows users to book DJ services, securely make payments using Stripe or Paystack, and receive real-time feedback on booking status. 
Built for production-readiness with emphasis on authentication, security, and user experience.

** Booking Workflow **

.Dynamic service selection with real-time pricing.

.Email capture and appointment ID generation.

.Stores appointment records securely in Postgres.

** Payment Integration **

.Stripe: Secure card payments with hosted payment elements and webhooks.

.Paystack: Supports Nigerian card payments, bank transfers, and USSD.

.Redirects to custom payment success pages with receipt summary.

** Authentication **

.Registration & login using Passport.js.

.Session-based login persistence.

.Access control to protect private pages (e.g., /payment-success-receipt).

** Security Measures **

.helmet() to enforce secure HTTP headers.

.Custom Content Security Policy (CSP) to whitelist Stripe, Paystack, and font CDNs.

.CSRF token protection on payment forms.

.Input validation and error handling throughout the application.

** Key Learning Points**

.Deep understanding of payment flows, from frontend form handling to backend verification.

.Managing middleware layers in Express with proper routing and modular structure.

.Writing secure, production-ready Node.js applications.

.Implementing client-server communication using fetch(), JSON, and REST APIs.

.Debugging real-world issues (CSP errors, environment-specific bugs, async/await flows).

